Package: appendMCP
Type: Package
Title: Tools for Defining Graphical Multiple Testing Procedures in Group Sequentially Designed Trials
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Yevgen", "Tymofyeyev", email = "ytymofye@its.jnj.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Michael", "Grayling", email = "mgraylin@its.jnj.com", role = c("aut"))
  )
Author: Yevgen Tymofyeyev [aut, cre], Michael Grayling [aut]
Maintainer: Yevgen Tymofyeyev <ytymofye@its.jnj.com>
Description:
    Provides routines for describing graphical multiple comparison
    procedures (MCPs) in trials with a group-sequential design (GSD). The
    objective is to generate an R Markdown file that defines the MTP and interim
    analyses, which can be appended to a statistical analysis plan document.
    The package provides predefined templates that can be modified by a user, 
    ideally by changing only high-level input parameters.
